The carrier did not inspect contents. The packing record is the merchant's own statement and conflicts with the serial, model and accessories. Step 1: non-conformity and counterfeit goods. AG3, merchant liable, refund EUR 469.00.","buyer_attachments":[{"type":"uploaded document","title":"ElectroCheck Antwerp inspection note 2026-11-08","text":"ElectroCheck, Lange Klarenstraat 12, Antwerp. Bench note 2026-11-08 for J. Buyer, order ord_001_23d556f2. Item presented as Nintendo Switch 2, black, serial claimed SNBA8DEE8E91. Findings: no Nintendo hologram; base label serial CLN4-88921-SX; boot string 'SX Clone firmware 1.2' / model 'clone-switch-compat'; shell scuffed; seal pre-cut and re-taped. Accessories present: two unmarked generic pads and one unbranded two-pin PSU. Absent: Joy-Con 2 pair, dock, HDMI cable, Nintendo EU adapter. Opinion: counterfeit, not model nintendo-switch-2, not New. Not a repair; visual and power-on check only."},{"type":"uploaded document","title":"Offer versus received variance","text":"Frozen offer p-switch2-mm versus goods unboxed 2026-11-07 18:05-18:15 CET: model nintendo-switch-2 vs clone-switch-compat; condition New vs resealed and scuffed; serial SNBA8DEE8E91 (merchant packing note only) vs label CLN4-88921-SX on the unit and on the inner tray; Joy-Con 2 pair absent; dock absent; HDMI cable absent; EU Nintendo power adapter absent. Colour black matches. Carton weight 1.6 kg matches the carrier scan, which did not inspect contents. Price paid EUR 469.00. Variance is the goods, not the payment."},{"type":"uploaded document","title":"Unboxing notes same evening as delivery","text":"Written 2026-11-07 18:20 CET after signing for the MegaMart parcel. Outer carton intact, 1.6 kg. Retail-style flap had a cut seal closed with clear tape. Inner tray held a black handheld, two loose grey pads with no Joy-Con rails, and a plain two-pin supply in a poly bag. No dock, no HDMI lead, no Nintendo paperwork. Label under the stand: CLN4-88921-SX. I powered it on; the screen read SX Clone firmware 1.2. Photos taken on my iPhone 15 Pro immediately after, before any return attempt."}],"buyer_photos":[{"description":"Close-up of the label under the console stand: serial CLN4-88921-SX, model line SX-CLONE, no Nintendo hologram, sticker lifting at one corner. Behind it the carton flap shows a cut seal reclosed with clear tape.","metadata":{"taken_at":"2026-11-07T17:06:11Z","device":"Apple iPhone 15 Pro"}},{"description":"Console powered on beside the carton. Screen text reads SX Clone firmware 1.2 and model clone-switch-compat. No Nintendo logo. Black shell scuffed on the right grip. Not a Switch 2.","metadata":{"taken_at":"2026-11-07T17:09:44Z","device":"Apple iPhone 15 Pro"}},{"description":"Full contents: one black clone console, two unmarked grey generic pads with no Joy-Con 2 rails, no dock, no HDMI cable, one unbranded two-pin supply. Offer accessories are absent.","metadata":{"taken_at":"2026-11-07T17:12:03Z","device":"Apple iPhone 15 Pro"}}],"rationale":"Step 1 is reached first and ignores mandate compliance, so a serial, model, condition and accessory mismatch against the self-reported packing note supports AG3 counterfeit non-conformity."}

